    "raw_text": "Reps. Jones, Barger, Anderson to Announce Plans to Force Vote on Stalled House Bill\nSeptember 25, 2026\nWHAT:\nThree Republican lawmakers will hold a news conference Monday afternoon to announce plans for a discharge petition involving a bill now before the state House of Representatives.\nWHO:\nReps. Mike Jones (R-York), Scott Barger (R-Blair/Huntingdon) and Marc Anderson (R-York).\nWHEN:\nMonday, Sept. 28, at 1:30 p.m.\nWHERE:\nPennsylvania Capitol Rotunda, Harrisburg, PA.\nLIVE WEBSTREAMING:\nPaHouseGOP.com/livestreams\nMedia contact:\nDonna Pinkham, 717.260.6452,\ndpinkham@pahousegop.com\nShare\nSign Up to Receive Legislative Email Updates\nKeep up-to-date on the latest legislative and community news. Your email address will be used strictly for legislative purposes.\nEmail*\nZIP Code\nSubscribe",
